<title>PHILIPPINES: Bank of Communications '96 net up 26.82 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Communications '96 net up 26.82 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Bank of Communications said it posted 396.01 million pesos in net income in 1996, up 26.82 percent from 312.26 million pesos in 1995.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) on Thursday, the bank said its total operating income for 1996 reached 3.083 billion pesos compared to 2.057 billion pesos the previous year.</p>
<p>The bank's total operating expenses amounted to 2.65 billion pesos last year from 1.70 billion pesos in 1995.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
